    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_default_sort",
      "label": "Default Sort Terbaru-Terlama",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Data terbaru paling berharga secara operasional; admin tidak perlu filter/tebak untuk menemukan data baru."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_paging_ui",
      "label": "Paging UI Berorientasi (Halaman X dari Y)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Paging tak terlihat membuat admin tidak tahu jumlah data dan posisinya; teks 'Ada data lebih lanjut' diganti label posisi + prev/next + jump."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_summary_strip",
      "label": "Summary Strip (Total + Breakdown)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Admin harus hitung manual atau scroll untuk orientasi; strip total + breakdown status memberi orientasi instan sebelum membaca baris."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_density_toggle",
      "label": "Row Density Toggle (Compact/Default/Comfortable)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Ahli butuh dense, pemula butuh lapang; preferensi di-persist di localStorage admin:table-density."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_sortable_header",
      "label": "Sortable Header via Klik Kolom",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Admin butuh sort kolom tanpa filter tambahan; toggle asc/desc dengan indikator arah dan query param sort/order."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_timestamp_columns",
      "label": "Kolom created_at/updated_at Terlihat",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Admin perlu tahu mana yang baru tanpa buka detail; berlaku untuk 5 tabel entitas, sales-performance dikecualikan karena agregat per-user per-periode tanpa timestamp."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_offset_cursor",
      "label": "Kontrak Offset Cursor Seragam",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Semua 6 tabel memakai offset cursor (cursor=0, limit, 2*limit) demi keseragaman jump paging; tradeoff skip/duplikat saat insert konkuren diterima karena volume admin kecil (~48-100 row)."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_meta_total",
      "label": "meta.total + meta.summary (Aditif)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Semua 6 controller mengembalikan top-level meta.total (COUNT(*) dengan filter sama) plus meta.summary; has_more dipertahankan. Frontend fallback ke label estimasi bila total absen."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_sort_allowlist",
      "label": "Sort Allowlist per Controller",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Param sort/order divalidasi terhadap allowlist per-controller; nilai invalid/berbahaya (__proto__, ; DROP) fallback diam ke created_at DESC, id DESC dengan HTTP 200 (bukan 422/500) untuk mencegah error/SQL injection."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_nulls_last",
      "label": "Nulls-Last Dua Arah",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Ordering pakai ekspresi portabel ORDER BY (col IS NULL) ASC, col dir, id DESC agar identik di PostgreSQL dan SQLite test tanpa bergantung NULLS LAST."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_dummy_mode_parity",
      "label": "Dummy-mode Parity",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Branch dummy di api.ts + helper listDummy* wajib implementasi sort/order/total identik agar tetap zero-network dan lolos dummy-guard.test.ts + dummy-mode.e2e.test.tsx."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_table_tsx_contract",
      "label": "Table.tsx Generic Contract (sortableColumns/sort/onSort)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Sortable state tinggal di Table via props opsional agar tetap generik; kolom Aksi inert; halaman orders (fetch inline tanpa api.ts) pakai props sama dengan local sort state."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_density_ssr_hydration",
      "label": "Density Persistence + SSR Hydration",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Initial density Default di server render; baca localStorage admin:table-density hanya di useEffect setelah mount agar tidak hydration mismatch, mirror pola readPersistedFlag di dummy/store.ts."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_authorization",
      "label": "Authorization Inherit Guard (sort/order/total)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Param baru inherit guard yang sudah ada (401/403 tidak berubah); orders tetap mempertahankan isAdmin() + middleware deny.finance."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pocket_spec_2026_09_17_admin_table_ux_admin_table_readability_option_b_full_paging",
      "label": "Design Decision: Option B — Full Paging",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "D:\\Development\\amal\\digital-distribution-management-platform\\docs\\pocket\\spec\\2026-09-17-admin-table-ux\\admin-table-readability.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": "brainstorm session",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Dipilih atas Option A (Smart Default saja — gagal skenario paging/cursor beyond total/reset state) dan Option C (Progressive bertahap — menambah risiko setengah jadi); tradeoff COUNT(*) + agregat dan offset cursor diterima."
